      "body": {
        "en": "*Gdzie jest…?* asks where something is. The answer: *tutaj* or *tu* (here), *tam* (there), *na lewo* (on the left), *na prawo* (on the right). Start with *przepraszam* to stop someone politely: *przepraszam, gdzie jest toaleta?*"
      }
